<title>UK: GSI sets call warrants on Clariant.</title>
<headline>GSI sets call warrants on Clariant.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Clariant AG, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Bank said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 50 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,100 CHF		 PREMIUM	17.89 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.20 CHF		  GEARING	5.41 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 08.AUG.97-19.MAR.99   PAYDATE	07.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  984 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
